WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.722 --> 00:00:02.130
Riesci a restare su?

2
00:00:02.390 --> 00:00:04.371
Dodici criceti.

3
00:00:04.531 --> 00:00:06.291
Una minuscola isola.

4
00:00:06.671 --> 00:00:08.051
Carica lo scatto...

5
00:00:08.451 --> 00:00:09.491
e falli volare.

6
00:00:09.671 --> 00:00:11.092
Prendi un'abilità.

7
00:00:11.232 --> 00:00:13.732
Esplosione, blocco o scambio...

8
00:00:14.232 --> 00:00:15.172
via dai guai!

9
00:00:15.832 --> 00:00:16.933
Sette mappe.

10
00:00:17.253 --> 00:00:18.693
Facciamo girare...

11
00:00:19.133 --> 00:00:19.893
Vulcano!

12
00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:21.333
Occhio a dove rotoli.

13
00:00:21.943 --> 00:00:23.094
Cinque modalità.

14
00:00:23.494 --> 00:00:29.095
Lotta per sopravvivere, corri al traguardo,
ruba la bandiera o esplora in libertà.

15
00:00:29.395 --> 00:00:31.095
Invita i tuoi amici.

16
00:00:31.215 --> 00:00:35.736
Condividi un codice, forma un
gruppo e tuffatevi insieme nel caos.

17
00:00:35.916 --> 00:00:37.336
Chi sta salvando chi?

18
00:00:37.956 --> 00:00:38.936
E adesso...

19
00:00:39.163 --> 00:00:40.136
il giro dei premi.

20
00:00:40.416 --> 00:00:41.497
Dai...

21
00:00:41.857 --> 00:00:42.457
dai...

22
00:00:42.777 --> 00:00:43.177
sì!

23
00:00:43.377 --> 00:00:44.857
Novantadue look.

24
00:00:44.993 --> 00:00:49.338
Ventitré criceti, ventinove palle e trenta scie.

25
00:00:49.698 --> 00:00:51.258
Scegli la dolcezza.

26
00:00:51.438 --> 00:00:52.938
Punta alle stelle.

27
00:00:53.138 --> 00:00:54.299
Scatenati un po'.

28
00:00:54.595 --> 00:00:57.659
Combina criceto, palla e scia.

29
00:00:57.799 --> 00:00:59.019
Tre pezzi.

30
00:00:59.166 --> 00:01:00.620
Un look tutto tuo.

31
00:01:01.113 --> 00:01:02.620
Pronti per un altro round?

32
00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:04.220
Hamster Bounce.

33
00:01:04.420 --> 00:01:05.260
Rotola.

34
00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:06.221
Carica.

35
00:01:06.437 --> 00:01:07.261
Falli volare.

36
00:01:07.477 --> 00:01:09.341
Scaricalo su Google Play.
